WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.313
A few numbers capture the impact.

00:00:02.393 --> 00:00:04.779
Across ninety real-world datasets,

00:00:04.859 --> 00:00:10.870
the tree kernel beats the multi-layer perceptron
kernel on more than thirty percent,

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:14.786
peaking near thirty-five percent when splits are hard,

00:00:14.866 --> 00:00:19.500
versus under twelve percent for the radial basis
function kernel.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:24.359
Most striking, the tree kernel's cost is
independent of tree depth,

00:00:24.439 --> 00:00:27.042
while the MLP kernel scales linearly.

00:00:27.122 --> 00:00:30.160
The depths studied span one to twenty-nine.
